  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "HG 1/100 VF-22S シュトゥルムフォーゲルII(マクシミリアン・ジーナス機)",
    "en": "HG 1/100 VF-22S Sturmvogel II (Maximilian Genus machine)"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 4730,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2025年02月22日 (土)",
    "year": 2025,
    "month": 2,
    "day": 22
  },
  "targetAge": 15,
  "scale": "1/100",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "最強の夫婦「マックス」と「ミリア」が搭乗するVF-22Sが、HG『マクロス』プラモシリーズに参戦！",
      "en": "The VF-22S piloted by the strongest couple \"Max \" and \" Milia \" joins the HG \" Macross\" plastic model series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• マックスが搭乗する「VF-22S シュトゥルムフォーゲルII(マクシミリアン・ジーナス機)」をHG『マクロス』プラモシリーズで商品化。",
      "en": "• \"VF-22S Sturmvogel II (Maximilian Genus aircraft)\", which Max flies, is commercialized in the HG \" Macross\" plastic model series."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 変形機構の一部に差し替えパーツを取り入れたことで、変形シークエンスの簡略化を実現。バトロイド、ガウォーク、ファイターへの簡単変形が可能。",
      "en": "• By incorporating replacement parts into part of the transformation mechanism, the transformation sequence has been simplified. Can be easily transformed into Battroid, Gerwalk, and Fighter."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「差替三段変形（ショートカットチェンジ）」の採用により、設定画をイメージした各形態のフォルムを追求。",
      "en": "• By adopting \"replacement three-stage transformation (shortcut change)\", we pursue the form of each form based on the image of the setting image."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 複雑な構造を除外し、ポージングを意識した最適な可動ポイントを設けることで新次元の可動性能を実現。",
      "en": "• A new dimension of movable performance has been achieved by eliminating complicated structures and creating optimal movable points with posing in mind."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部は首の根元の可動軸とボールジョイントにより細かな表情付けが可能。",
      "en": "• The head has a movable axis at the base of the neck and a ball joint, allowing for detailed expressions."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩部はダクト部と肩関節が可動することで広範囲な可動域を確保。",
      "en": "• The shoulder area has a wide range of motion due to the movement of the duct and shoulder joint."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胸部は軸可動を複数内蔵することで前後左右への広域な可動を実現。",
      "en": "• The chest has multiple axes of movement, allowing for a wide range of movement from front to back, left to right, and from side to side."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 偏光成形を使用したキャノピーは開閉が可能。",
      "en": "• Canopy using polarized molding can be opened and closed."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「ピンポイントバリアパンチ」再現用エフェクトパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes effect parts to reproduce \"Pinpoint Barrier Punch\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 極薄ながらも優れた隠蔽性を発揮するネーマーシールが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes Namer Seal, which is extremely thin but has excellent concealment properties."
    }
  ],
